      ChatResponses:
        Answers:
        - Content: "Updated `SimpleWordChooser` in [Wordchooser.cs](<Wordchooser.cs:1>)
            to use the Unity Input System Package, resolving the `InvalidOperationException`
            under the project\u2019s new input handling mode.\n\n## Changes made\n\n-
            **Input handling:** Replaced `UnityEngine.Input` keyboard polling with
            the Input System keyboard API.\n- **Bindings preserved:** `A` and Left
            Arrow select the left category, while `D` and Right Arrow select the
            right category.\n- **Game flow preserved:** Existing resolving-state
            checks, word animations, correctness evaluation, score updates, feedback
            colors, and round progression remain unchanged."
